<Text title="Contact us | thetoolproject" description="Contact thetoolproject about a tool, a bug, or a question. Email us or open a GitHub issue." heading="Contact us" lead="Tell us what you are trying to do, what went wrong, or which tool would help." path="/contact/">
  <h2>Email us</h2>
  <p>Write to <a href="mailto:hello@thetoolproject.com">hello@thetoolproject.com</a> for questions, feedback, or anything you would prefer to discuss privately. If you are reporting a bug, include the tool name, what you expected, and what happened. Please leave out sensitive files and personal data.</p>

  <h2>Report a bug or suggest a tool</h2>
  <p>Use <a href="https://github.com/harshit-dixit/thetoolproject.com/issues/new">GitHub Issues</a> for public bug reports and ideas. You can also browse <a href="https://github.com/harshit-dixit/thetoolproject.com/issues">existing issues</a> before posting. GitHub requires an account to open an issue; email works without one.</p>

  <h2>Contribute code</h2>
  <p>The <a href="https://github.com/harshit-dixit/thetoolproject.com">source repository</a> is open to inspect and improve. If you have a fix, start with an issue or send a pull request.</p>
</Text>
